# FloodGuard Penang line-ending policy.
#
# Golden station-master fixtures are compared byte-for-byte against writer
# output, and the writer contract is LF (`csv.writer(lineterminator="\n")`
# in scripts/build_station_master.py). Force LF checkouts for these files so
# Windows `core.autocrlf=true` cannot convert them to CRLF and break the
# golden comparison. This changes no semantics: the blobs are already LF.

tests/fixtures/station_master/expected/*.csv text eol=lf
